Credits and inspiration:

* Graphify (package `graphifyy`, Apache-2.0,
  https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify) inspired the knowledge-graph
  extraction model and the graph.json format VeriGraph emits. VeriGraph's
  extraction code is an independent, original implementation and does not
  copy Graphify's source.

* The veracity grading is powered by the OverCaml veracity engine by
  Nathaniel Timmis: the three-valued (TRUE/FALSE/UNKNOWN) ternary logic,
  content-hash idempotency, and invariant / contradiction checking are ported
  from that engine into this project.
